                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi k
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k
            over the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/projective+space"} projective space
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi k
                  %msup
                    %mi P
                    %mi n
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k P^n
            is the following vertical
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bundle"} bundle
            map:
          #eq:TautologicalBundleProjection.maruku-equation
