                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{O}_k(1)
            ”, which in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+geometry"} algebraic geometry
            is standard notation for its
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelian+sheaf"} abelian sheaf
            of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sections"} sections
          %ul
